    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's the thing... i feel like i've already failed too much to \"change\" anything. every time i see them smile or talk about my future, it just feels like a knife in my chest because i know i'm just a lie to them. if i could just stop being this person, or just stop being here, maybe the shame wouldn't be so heavy for everyone. i just want the weight to go away.",
